        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Amorphous formation in Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20 is strongly dependent on cooling rate.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20 exhibits complicated phase-transformation or crystallization behavior during thermal analysis.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed intervention is to incorporate 2–5 at% B into Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding B will enhance the glass-forming ability of Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding B will improve the thermal stability of the amorphous phase during reheating.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt-spinning at approximately 10^5–10^6 K/s produces an amorphous structure in the undoped Cr16Mn16Fe16Co16Ni16P20 alloy.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled moderate DSC heating ramps are proposed for comparing thermal stability and crystallization.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "B atoms form strong covalent-like bonds in the proposed alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "B promotes local chemical short-range order that inhibits crystalline nucleation during cooling and heating.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "B reduces atomic mobility by increasing the energy barrier for diffusion and crystallization.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "B disrupts regular atomic arrangements that would otherwise nucleate crystalline phases.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The B-modified alloy will retain an amorphous structure over a broader range of rapid cooling rates than the undoped alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The B-modified alloy will remain amorphous to higher reheating temperatures and show delayed or suppressed DSC crystallization exotherms.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Within the reported cooling conditions, the undoped alloy requires cooling near 10^5 K/s or faster to become fully amorphous.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The undoped alloy rapidly crystallizes upon reheating.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The B intervention should succeed at cooling rates of at least approximately 10^5 K/s.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "At slower cooling rates or below a critical B concentration, the modified alloy may remain partly crystalline or crystallize rapidly during heating.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher B concentrations may cause secondary phases to emerge.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
